  values ('ME', 'long_answer', 'b) One of the most exciting and memorable moments of the 112th National Day was the announcement of the institution of Gyalsung (National Service) for youths by His Majesty the King. In your opinion, how would Gyalsung benefit in providing direction and encouraging our youth to be strong, independent thinkers, capable of serving the Tsa-wa-sum? Please explain. (10 marks)', 'b) His Majesty announced Gyalsung on the 112th National Day (17 December 2019). It provides young Bhutanese, around the age of 18, with a period of national service combining basic military training with skills training. Benefits: (1) discipline, resilience, physical fitness and leadership; (2) practical skills - in areas such as construction, agriculture, digital technology and entrepreneurship - preparing youth for jobs or further study and giving them direction; (3) bringing young people from every region and background together, strengthening national identity and unity; (4) a sense of duty to the Tsa-wa-sum and readiness to serve in disasters and national emergencies; (5) learning to solve problems, think independently and make decisions; and (6) reducing idleness, frustration and substance abuse among youth. Gyalsung can thus produce confident, capable and patriotic citizens.', null, '[{"point": "Gyalsung: announced 17 December 2019; one year of national service for youth (around age 18) with military basics and skills training", "marks": 3}, {"point": "Benefits: discipline, resilience and leadership; skills (vocational, digital, agriculture, construction) for jobs; national identity and unity across backgrounds; service to Tsa-wa-sum and disaster readiness; critical thinking and confidence; reduces idleness and substance abuse", "marks": 7}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development') and t.slug = 'royal-patronage-and-national-service'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-general-3'), 'standard', 10,
